      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "It disappoints me to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "hear you say that. Never"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "say such a thing to me again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Hm. Contemplate the meanings"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "of courage and cowardice, and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "then speak to me once again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Regroup? It is good to do that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "after you have been defeated."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "But it is best to face problems"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "once you encounter them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "You will not always have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "the luxury of regrouping."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Problems can be predicted"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "and analyzed, but I think"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "immediate retreat is unwise."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Contemplate on your fears,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "as well as what you define as"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "failure. Then, return to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "On your travels, you will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "encounter many people with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "differing backgrounds and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "viewpoints. Inevitably, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "will encounter someone whose"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "way of life you cannot fathom."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Likewise, this person will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "not understand your way of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "life. When your two viewpoints"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "clash, causing heated conflict,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "how would you respond?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Insist that I'm right, regardless"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Disregard conflicting viewpoint"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Accept differences and learn from them"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "It's important to have your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "own opinion. However, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "must recognize that you may"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "be wrong, and an opposing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "view may have some merit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "There is no one right"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "answer and the light of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "truth can take many shades."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Such is the way of nature."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "To force ideas on others is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "an oppressive practice."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Do not limit yourself"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "to a single view, and do"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "not stifle your growth by"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "adhering to a single truth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Contemplate on this, and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "then speak with me again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "It is important to get"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "along with others, but"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "you will bring no value"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "to this world without your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "own unique contributions,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "thoughts and opinions."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "A conflict of ideals, when"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "conducted with respect for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "yourself and others, is a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 289,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "great opportunity to broaden"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 290,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "your understanding of the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "world as it is to others."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 293,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Reflect on this idea of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "establishing harmony with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 296,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "the self, and harmony with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "others. Then, return to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Good. You must see"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 302,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "differences for what they"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "truly are. You must also"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "take criticism to your own"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "views with grace and "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "sincere consideration."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "It is impossible to know"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "everything in this world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "It is impossible to understand"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "every view. But that does not"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "mean that views you do not"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "understand are meritless."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 317,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "The one with whom you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "disagree may have the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "answer you do not know."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "In your time of weakness,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "this person may be your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "greatest help. Remember that."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "I am satisfied by the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "answers you have given"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "me. Please reflect on what"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "we have discussed for a little"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "while. When your mind is calm,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "come and speak to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 337,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Are you feeling calm"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "and at peace? I will ask"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "you a very important question."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Give me your honest answer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "^FF0000Are you ready to dedicate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "yourself to the special art"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "I will teach you, and uphold"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 346,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "the dignity of its philosophy?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Very well. You are no"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "longer just a student."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "You are now entrusted with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "the powers and responsibilities"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "of a disciple of ^FF0000Taekwon Do^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "''Taekwon'' has the meaning"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "of ''punching and kicking,''"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "and ''Do'' has the meaning"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "of ''art.'' This martial art is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "focused on skills using"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "the fists and the feet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Please use this discipline"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "to hone your body and mind"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "and learn the skills that are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 368,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "best suited to you. Never"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "shirk your training, or bring"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "shame to Taekwon Do."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 376,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 377,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "You are still young, so"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 378,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "I assume you'll want a job"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "title. Mm. In that case, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "are now a ^FF0000Taekwon Girl^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 383,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "are now a ^FF0000Taekwon Boy^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Yes, that sounds good. "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "Please, take this training"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "uniform and guard set: make"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "good use of these gifts. As"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "you travel and train, enlighten"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "others about our art and learn what you can from them in return."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "[Phoenix]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Phoenix",
      "text" : "It is now time for you to"
    },
    {
